(7601850, 1228277, 83313, '<td valign="top">Really nice long exposure. The only thing keeping me from giving it a very high score is the cropping doesn''t work for me.I think there is too much empty area at the top at bottom that draws my eye away from the beautiful smooth water in the middle left. I might have gone with more of a panoramic crop. Take that for what it is, a personal opinion. Still on the positive side of the scale, though.</td>', 'Really nice long exposure. The only thing keeping me from giving it a very high score is the cropping doesn''t work for me.I think there is too much empty area at the top at bottom that draws my eye away from the beautiful smooth water in the middle left. I might have gone with more of a panoramic crop. Take that for what it is, a personal opinion. Still on the positive side of the scale, though.', '2018-11-09 20:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
